&lt;li&gt;Design and evolve systems that support safe, scalable, AI-augmented development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and experimentation to validate whether solutions actually work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally to balance member impact, clinical constraints, and technical tradeoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how we work—our tools, processes, and culture&lt;/li&gt;
