&lt;p&gt;You’ll foster a high-autonomy, high-accountability culture where engineers thrive, and you’ll help Pelago scale secure, reliable AI systems that patients and providers can trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a hybrid role with a high-collaboration rhythm (3 days/week in our NYC office).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
