&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and grow a high-autonomy, high-accountability engineering team&lt;/strong&gt;, mentoring engineers and fostering a culture of ownership, curiosity, and excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead from the front as a hands-on builder&lt;/strong&gt;, pairing with engineers to prototype, debug, and deliver robust, user-facing product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive end-to-end execution of AI initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, from rapid experimentation through secure, reliable production deployment with a high bar for quality and trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help grow and strengthen our NYC engineering presence while collaborating closely with our London team&lt;/strong&gt;, serving as a culture carrier and talent magnet as Pelago scales globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift the team from output to outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;, framing ambiguous problem spaces, running fast learning loops, and ensuring work is measured by real member and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set technical direction and raise engineering standards&lt;/strong&gt;, focusing reviews and decision-making on architecture, system behavior, and long-term scalability rather than implementation minutiae.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The background we are looking for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading one or more engineering teams with accountability for technical execution, delivery, and quality across architecture, development, and production in fast-paced environments where speed and quality both matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success guiding teams through the end-to-end delivery of complex, user-facing, AI-native products, from system design and technical decision-making through production and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to hire, mentor, and develop engineers across multiple career stages, fostering high-performing teams with strong ownership and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical judgment, with a track record of making sound tradeoffs around experimentation, technical debt, and long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience partnering cross-functionally with Product, Design, Data, and Clinical to align technical execution with user, clinical, and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
